  "content": "\n\n<h1><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1391061/description_efbfc10e-a5c7-4369-8a87-767bc68fbebf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"849\" height=\"163\"></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Codex 是一款以技能与能力为核心的成长向RPG模组。</strong><br><strong>你可以通过游玩进行升级并获取点数，利用被动属性加成和主动战斗能力来塑造角色。所有功能均集成在物品栏面板与专用技能书界面中统一管理。</strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1391061/description_4536a681-8bad-4e1e-867a-3a7bc935d2f6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"413\" height=\"79\"></p>\n<p><br><br><strong>&bull; </strong>基于等级缩放的技能与能力进阶系统<br><strong>&bull; </strong>通过战斗与升级积累进度<br><strong>&bull; </strong>消耗技能点提升被动属性（生命值、护甲、速度、运气、击退抗性等）<br><strong>&bull; </strong>消耗能力点解锁主动技能（位移、辅助、防御与攻击）<br><strong>&bull;</strong> 支持升级的技能，具备独立等级、冷却时间与数值成长<br><strong>&bull;</strong> 能力HUD显示冷却状态，并支持快捷按键绑定<br><strong>&bull;</strong> 集成于物品栏的技能/能力面板 + 专用技能书界面<br><strong>&bull;</strong> 升级或获得点数时触发屏幕提示（Toast）<br><strong>&bull;</strong> 支持酿造含Codex药水效果的药剂（含能力强度加成）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1391061/description_bff30428-26d4-4bb4-81a9-d5ab34c6fe7f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"848\" height=\"364\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><strong>命令：</strong><br>◦ /codex points add &lt;amount&gt;<br>◦ /codex points set &lt;amount&gt;<br>◦ /codex points reset<br>◦ /codex skills reset<br>◦ /codex abilities reset</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252frevilodev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1391061/description_0319d947-d5a9-45be-8b1c-4a7f1bce42dc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"267\" height=\"85\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/revilodev/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1391061/description_901f915d-57c8-4d87-8269-aea435c85b48.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fReviloDev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1391061/description_2fbe8561-3d3a-4ea7-a342-6fe515869f42.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"></a><a style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"https://discord.gg/DARzByw6VW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1391061/description_323e6baf-a51e-489c-9877-5dad505ab153.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"></a><span style=\"color:#e5e5e5\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13)\"><a style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frevilodev.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1391061/description_5131ac43-34b5-447c-a0a6-53d74d145f87.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"269\" height=\"85\"></a></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frevilodev.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
